      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Welcome to NexaTech Solutions, {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.name }}!",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #1e3a8a; border-bottom: 2px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Welcome to NexaTech Solutions</h2>\n  <p>Dear <strong>{{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.name }}</strong>,</p>\n  <p>Thank you for expressing interest in our <strong>{{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.interestedService }}</strong> services for <strong>{{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.companyName }}</strong>.</p>\n  <p>We are excited about the opportunity to partner with you. At <strong>NexaTech Solutions</strong>, we specialize in driving business growth through tailored automation, digital solutions, and strategic technology consulting.</p>\n  <div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: #334155;\">Your Inquiry Details:</h4>\n    <p style=\"margin: 4px 0;\"><strong>Service:</strong> {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.interestedService }}</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 4px 0;\"><strong>Company:</strong> {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.companyName }}</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 4px 0;\"><strong>Your Message:</strong> <em>\"{{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.message }}\"</em></p>\n  </div>\n  <p>Our solution consultant is already reviewing your inquiry and will reach out within <strong>24 business hours</strong> with a customized plan and initial recommendations.</p>\n  <p>If you have any urgent questions, feel free to reply directly to this email.</p>\n  <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 24px 0;\" />\n  <p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n    Warm regards,<br />\n    <strong>Maruf Ahmed Masum</strong><br />\n    Head of Business Solutions | NexaTech Solutions<br />\n    <a href=\"mailto:dostmasum@gmail.com\" style=\"color: #3b82f6;\">dostmasum@gmail.com</a>\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        },
        "operation": "send"
